# UMKIM global

- Patterns: [docs/design.md](../../docs/design.md) · Host layout: `inventory/`
- Agent entry: `AGENTS.md` → `.cursor/skills/`
- Shared Ansible vars: `inventory/group_vars/all/common.yml` (directory `all/` shadows `all.yml`).
- Lab SSH user `linux`; hub host from `inventory/hosts.yml` `[hub]` group.
- Prefer playbook **tags** over full `fleet-deploy.yml` when scope is narrow.
- Do not commit unless asked; no secrets in new files.
